                <div class="accordion-body">We use standard metrics (accuracy, precision, recall, RMSE, etc.) plus business metrics, e.g. revenue impact, cost saved, or error rate in production. We define success criteria up front and track them in dashboards so you see real impact, not just model scores.</div>
